{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香！お誕生日おめでとう！\nれいかのキャプテン好きだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみなさん、\n沢山のコメントありがとう(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2000件以上ものメッセージ、\n一つ一つ大切に\n読ませていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆さん、\n心優しくていい人...T^T"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中、真夏のコメントもあったよ！\nうん、嬉しいね(*´ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、昔から人には恵まれてるなって\n思ってて、アイドルになっても\nそれは変わらないよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいなぁ( ∩ˇωˇ∩)\nいっぱい頑張れるよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがと(∩*´ω` *∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚目の製作も\n着々と進んでいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見せられない衣装ばかり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表情で読み取ってちょ！\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白く光ってるまいやんに\n頭をつままれとる...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この表情は最近お気に入り。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空いてる時間に\nプリンシパルの稽古も..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日大忙しじゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとこの間ですね、\n懐かしい写真を発見しちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校時代の私どん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ、若い...懐かしい...\nすっぴんなのにこの肌だった昔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁもう20歳か。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃の私にとってはスタバも\n珍味だったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが今ではこんな風に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2014/05/17/5252310/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前書いて貰えるんだもんな...！\n凄いな〜東京って凄いな〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング＼(^o^)／久々にuse"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は名古屋の全国握手会♪♪\nせいたんと一緒のレーンですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの名古屋楽しみ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこの辺で♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最後に\nさゆりんのブログ面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏生まれは夏や太陽が苦手とか\nいうやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみは太陽とか\nなんでも仲良くできそうとか\n書いてくれてたけど...\nなんかありがとう(っ`∀´*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はさゆりんの言う通り\nお日様とは条約くめるくらい\n仲良しよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜかというと、\n日に当たらない日が続くと\n私はわかりやすいくらい\n気分が暗くなり\n喋らなくなるのである！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日焼けもあまり気にしない！\nポジティブだから！\n私寒がりだから\n夏でもパーカー着れるし！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海行きたい！冬も好きだけどさ！\nでは！！！"}],"source":"archive"}